<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-025" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-025-jin098-huanwen-succession" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-025-jin098-huanwen-succession">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-025-jin098-huanwen-succession:bow" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">侍中<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-025-jin098-huanwen-succession:bow:m0002" ref="aa6_83c_juy_B">謝公</persName>見<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-025-jin098-huanwen-succession:bow:m0005" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓公</persName>拜。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-025-jin098-huanwen-succession:bow:m0009" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓</persName>驚笑曰：「<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-025-jin098-huanwen-succession:bow:m0015" ref="aa6_83c_juy_B">安石</persName>，卿何事至爾？」<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-025-jin098-huanwen-succession:bow:m0025" ref="aa6_83c_juy_B">謝</persName>曰：「未有君拜於前，臣立於後！」</p>
</text>
